			"hadithnumber": 2239,
			"arabicnumber": 2239,
			"text": "It was narrated from Ibn 'Umar that the Prophet (ﷺ) said:\"O Allah, bless my nation in their early mornings.\". It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that the Prophet (ﷺ) said: \"Whoever buys a Musarrah, he has the choice (of annulling the deal) for three days. If he returns it, then he must also give a Sa' of dates, not Samra'.\" Meaning wheat",
